     "<div dir=\"auto\">Stop<br><br><div dir=\"ltr\"><br><blockquote type=\"cite\">On Jun 20, 2023, at 9:38 PM, <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">lav...@googlegroups.com</a> wrote:<br><br></blockquote></div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div dir=\"ltr\">﻿\r\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #d3d3d3;max-width:850px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000\">\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;padding:10px 20px\">\r\n    <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\">\r\n      <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <td style=\"width:70%\">\r\n            <span style=\"font:18px/20px arial;color:#333333\">\r\n              <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email#!forum/lavaan/topics\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:#333333\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail%23!forum/lavaan/topics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792415875855000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3XZo39OiJlDHaSvTA4BKYd\">\r\n              lav...@googlegroups.com</a>\r\n            </span>\r\n          </td>\r\n          <td style=\"text-align:right;width:30%\">\r\n            <span style=\"font:20px/24px arial\"><a style=\"color:#dd4b39;text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email/#!overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail/%23!overview&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792415875855000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0YoyzXQ5QIfQ1ee-7pLRbL\">Google Groups</a></span>\r\n          </td>\r\n          <td style=\"width:32px\">\r\n            <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email/#!overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail/%23!overview&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792415875855000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0YoyzXQ5QIfQ1ee-7pLRbL\"><img style=\"border:0;vertical-align:middle\" src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/4SGWHe9midrWMDxDIJMQraTMMgnAU71soPZ0D28IOSZcs66TdyRoCqyIhaTt-kwo0YKv2lRo05RkwsGFZdnFhdvy60XdxNlL2U-B=s0-d-e1-ft#http://www.google.com/images/icons/product/groups-32.png\"></a>\r\n          </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n      </tbody>\r\n    </table>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div style=\"padding:20px;background-color:#f5f5f5\">\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:arial;color:#222222;padding:0px\">\r\n  <a name=\"m_-5682900014707558982_digest_top\" style=\"font-size:21px\" rel=\"nofollow\">\r\n  \r\n    Today&#39;s topic summary\r\n  \r\n  \r\n  </a><br>\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:11px\">\r\n    <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email#!forum/lavaan/topics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail%23!forum/lavaan/topics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792415875855000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3XZo39OiJlDHaSvTA4BKYd\">View all topics</a>\r\n  </span>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font:13px/18px arial;color:#222222;padding:0px;margin-bottom:30px\">\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-left:3px;padding-left:0px\">\r\n  \r\n    <li>\r\n      <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_-5682900014707558982_group_thread_0\" rel=\"nofollow\">\r\n      MGCFA and parameterization</a> -\r\n      <span style=\"color:#777777\">1 Update</span>\r\n    </li>\r\n  \r\n    <li>\r\n      <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_-5682900014707558982_group_thread_1\" rel=\"nofollow\">\r\n      LGCM: quadratic model with several predictors and interactions</a> -\r\n      <span style=\"color:#777777\">1 Update</span>\r\n    </li>\r\n  \r\n    <li>\r\n      <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_-5682900014707558982_group_thread_2\" rel=\"nofollow\">\r\n      extracting information from a fitted lavaan object</a> -\r\n      <span style=\"color:#777777\">5 Updates</span>\r\n    </li>\r\n  \r\n    <li>\r\n      <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_-5682900014707558982_group_thread_3\" rel=\"nofollow\">\r\n      EFA WLSMV maximum sample sizes</a> -\r\n      <span style=\"color:#777777\">1 Update</span>\r\n    </li>\r\n  \r\n    <li>\r\n      <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_-5682900014707558982_group_thread_4\" rel=\"nofollow\">\r\n      Bad fit of measurement model between SPSS AMOS and R lavaan</a> -\r\n      <span style=\"color:#777777\">1 Update</span>\r\n    </li>\r\n  \r\n  </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_-5682900014707558982_group_thread_0\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\r\n  <div style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:arial;padding:4px 0 5px 0px\">\r\n  \r\n    <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/t/d7d15193754c6d3b?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" style=\"font-size:21px;color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/t/d7d15193754c6d3b?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792415875855000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2SDwjHFwtEddrkozvWsThk\">\r\n      MGCFA and parameterization\r\n    </a>\r\n  \r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\r\n    \r\n    <tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#2e2e2e;font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid #d3d3d3\">\r\n      <span style=\"color:#b1b0b0;font-size:15px\">\r\n        jakob h &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">Jak...@gmx.de</a>&gt;: Jun 20 12:31PM -0700\r\n      </span>\r\n      <br><br>\r\n      Dear Terrence,<br>\r\n <br>\r\nMy sincere apologies for my late response and thank you for taking the time <br>\r\nto answer my questions, this is extremely helpful! I really appreciate your <br>\r\nhelp!<br>\r\n\r\n      \r\n        <span style=\"font-size:11px\"><a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/222d2719a5a17?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/222d2719a5a17?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792415875855000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2e2VIkZyf8SHwhzgWeA6CO\">...more</a></span>\r\n        <br>\r\n      \r\n    </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  <div style=\"font-size:11px;margin-bottom:40px;margin-top:5px\">\r\n    <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_-5682900014707558982_digest_top\" rel=\"nofollow\">Back to top</a>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_-5682900014707558982_group_thread_1\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\r\n  <div style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:arial;padding:4px 0 5px 0px\">\r\n  \r\n    <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/t/7c8513d53d8b2541?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" style=\"font-size:21px;color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/t/7c8513d53d8b2541?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792415875855000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2wsFbLC1feIiWiTCqzUxRL\">\r\n      LGCM: quadratic model with several predictors and interactions\r\n    </a>\r\n  \r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\r\n    \r\n    <tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#2e2e2e;font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid #d3d3d3\">\r\n      <span style=\"color:#b1b0b0;font-size:15px\">\r\n        Keith Markus &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">kma...@aol.com</a>&gt;: Jun 20 06:58AM -0700\r\n      </span>\r\n      <br><br>\r\n      Mili,<br>\r\nWhen you say everything is fine you only mean that there is no negative <br>\r\nvariance, not that the model fits well, correct?  One possibility is that <br>\r\nthe negative variance is compensating for\r\n      \r\n        <span style=\"font-size:11px\"><a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/210a651595d17?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/210a651595d17?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792415875855000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3CZKtbdVzDcx17ICJNEB9f\">...more</a></span>\r\n        <br>\r\n      \r\n    </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  <div style=\"font-size:11px;margin-bottom:40px;margin-top:5px\">\r\n    <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_-5682900014707558982_digest_top\" rel=\"nofollow\">Back to top</a>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_-5682900014707558982_group_thread_2\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\r\n  <div style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:arial;padding:4px 0 5px 0px\">\r\n  \r\n    <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/t/7008629b5b906168?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" style=\"font-size:21px;color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/t/7008629b5b906168?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792415875855000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0zzXGdMWZH_IzZ_pdhbHKg\">\r\n      extracting information from a fitted lavaan object\r\n    </a>\r\n  \r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\r\n    \r\n    <tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#2e2e2e;font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid #d3d3d3\">\r\n      <span style=\"color:#b1b0b0;font-size:15px\">\r\n        &quot;R. Schulz&quot; &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">r.sch...@student.rug.nl</a>&gt;: Jun 20 03:56AM -0700\r\n      </span>\r\n      <br><br>\r\n      Hello,<br>\r\n <br>\r\nI fitted a mediation model with the following code: <br>\r\n <br>\r\nmodel1 &lt;- &#39;<br>\r\n# measurement model <br>\r\nPF =~ 1*rand9 + p8*rand10 <br>\r\nV =~ 1*rand23 + v2*rand27 <br>\r\nGH =~ gh1*rand1 + gh5*rand36 \r\n      \r\n        <span style=\"font-size:11px\"><a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/206b473f48c62?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/206b473f48c62?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792415875855000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0x5T_x8dy7bHRNvdKyF5Ne\">...more</a></span>\r\n        <br>\r\n      \r\n    </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n    <tr><td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#2e2e2e;font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid #d3d3d3\">\r\n      <span style=\"color:#b1b0b0;font-size:15px\">\r\n        &quot;Shu Fai Cheung (張樹輝)&quot; &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">shufai...@gmail.com</a>&gt;: Jun 20 04:24AM -0700\r\n      </span>\r\n      <br><br>\r\n      Dear Rebecca,<br>\r\n <br>\r\nThe call to lavInspect() you used only give you the parameter estimates in <br>\r\nthe model matrices. The M you defined is a derived parameter that does not <br>\r\nexist in the matrix.<br>\r\n\r\n      \r\n        <span style=\"font-size:11px\"><a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/2083d72bf0d28?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/2083d72bf0d28?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792415875855000&amp;usg=AOvVaw078YfGnc_GUgqi7eJHiasK\">...more</a></span>\r\n        <br>\r\n      \r\n    </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n    <tr><td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#2e2e2e;font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid #d3d3d3\">\r\n      <span style=\"color:#b1b0b0;font-size:15px\">\r\n        Christian Arnold &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">Christia...@hhl.de</a>&gt;: Jun 20 11:25AM\r\n      </span>\r\n      <br><br>\r\n      Well, your self-defined parameter is not included in the matrix. In any case, I would proceed differently when extracting the parameters. There are several solutions that are more convenient and safer\r\n      \r\n        <span style=\"font-size:11px\"><a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/20850b5e4d61c?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/20850b5e4d61c?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792415875855000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0dA9w6RHCmFsBKfMFsTvvk\">...more</a></span>\r\n        <br>\r\n      \r\n    </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n    <tr><td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#2e2e2e;font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid #d3d3d3\">\r\n      <span style=\"color:#b1b0b0;font-size:15px\">\r\n        &quot;Shu Fai Cheung (張樹輝)&quot; &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">shufai...@gmail.com</a>&gt;: Jun 20 04:28AM -0700\r\n      </span>\r\n      <br><br>\r\n      coef(fit, type = &quot;user&quot;)[&quot;M&quot;] <br>\r\n <br>\r\nI am not aware of this method to use coef()! I learned a new technique. <br>\r\nThanks!  :)<br>\r\n <br>\r\n-- Shu Fai<br>\r\n <br>\r\n\r\n      \r\n        <span style=\"font-size:11px\"><a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/2087b0fa76a41?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/2087b0fa76a41?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792415875855000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1L3LTgnj73HgteEVw_d7sH\">...more</a></span>\r\n        <br>\r\n      \r\n    </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n    <tr><td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#2e2e2e;font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid #d3d3d3\">\r\n      <span style=\"color:#b1b0b0;font-size:15px\">\r\n        &quot;Schulz, R.&quot; &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">r.sch...@student.rug.nl</a>&gt;: Jun 20 01:46PM +0200\r\n      </span>\r\n      <br><br>\r\n      Hi both,<br>\r\n <br>\r\nThank you for your help, I appreciate it! I solved my problem now.<br>\r\n(Btw all the solutions worked).<br>\r\n <br>\r\n <br>\r\nOn Tue, Jun 20, 2023 at 1:28 PM Shu Fai Cheung (張樹輝) &lt;<br>\r\n\r\n      \r\n        <span style=\"font-size:11px\"><a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/20971a23c36a2?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/20971a23c36a2?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792415875855000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Nks3GqW-mn3mtqiqB4Y2X\">...more</a></span>\r\n        <br>\r\n      \r\n    </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  <div style=\"font-size:11px;margin-bottom:40px;margin-top:5px\">\r\n    <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_-5682900014707558982_digest_top\" rel=\"nofollow\">Back to top</a>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_-5682900014707558982_group_thread_3\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\r\n  <div style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:arial;padding:4px 0 5px 0px\">\r\n  \r\n    <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/t/d1b7d28ff6c0dfe2?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" style=\"font-size:21px;color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/t/d1b7d28ff6c0dfe2?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792415875855000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0fnHae6UFTRCokcwfSLCn-\">\r\n      EFA WLSMV maximum sample sizes\r\n    </a>\r\n  \r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\r\n    \r\n    <tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#2e2e2e;font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid #d3d3d3\">\r\n      <span style=\"color:#b1b0b0;font-size:15px\">\r\n        Yves Rosseel &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">yros...@gmail.com</a>&gt;: Jun 20 01:11PM +0200\r\n      </span>\r\n      <br><br>\r\n      On 6/19/23 20:48, Dani Broxy wrote:<br>\r\n <br>\r\n&gt; Twofactor&lt;-efa(data, nfactors=2, estimator = &quot;WLSMV&quot;, rotation = &quot;Oblimin&quot;)<br>\r\n&gt; The model has 55 items and N= 1498. The indicators are categorical but \r\n      \r\n        <span style=\"font-size:11px\"><a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/207940c019ae6?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/207940c019ae6?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792415875855000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Te7pPvy3OhuBhK8lPs9zq\">...more</a></span>\r\n        <br>\r\n      \r\n    </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  <div style=\"font-size:11px;margin-bottom:40px;margin-top:5px\">\r\n    <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_-5682900014707558982_digest_top\" rel=\"nofollow\">Back to top</a>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_-5682900014707558982_group_thread_4\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\r\n  <div style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:arial;padding:4px 0 5px 0px\">\r\n  \r\n    <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/t/45a7654865339855?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" style=\"font-size:21px;color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/t/45a7654865339855?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792415875855000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ZIjV33AwvQzf57gjMeybR\">\r\n      Bad fit of measurement model between SPSS AMOS and R lavaan\r\n    </a>\r\n  \r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\r\n    \r\n    <tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#2e2e2e;font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid #d3d3d3\">\r\n      <span style=\"color:#b1b0b0;font-size:15px\">\r\n        Janez Gorenc &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">janez...@gmail.com</a>&gt;: Jun 19 08:29PM -0700\r\n      </span>\r\n      <br><br>\r\n      THank you very much for your comments, Jeremy. I will try to make these <br>\r\nchanges. Yes, of course she uses AMOS.<br>\r\n <br>\r\n\r\n      \r\n        <span style=\"font-size:11px\"><a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/1ee5748b46c71?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/1ee5748b46c71?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792415875855000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2bRBpuEDmU33Guru9w876p\">...more</a></span>\r\n        <br>\r\n      \r\n    </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  <div style=\"font-size:11px;margin-bottom:40px;margin-top:5px\">\r\n    <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_-5682900014707558982_digest_top\" rel=\"nofollow\">B